---
// Assamese Jaapi & Classical Tala Acoustic Mandala (জাপি আৰু তাল চক্ৰ)
// Code-generated SVG blending Assamese cultural iconography with Indian classical rhythmic geometry
---

<div class="ledger-box p-6 my-8 text-center font-mono">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-paper-pencil dark:border-terminal-wire pb-2 mb-4 text-xs">
    <div class="font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="text-paper-red dark:text-terminal-amber">ARCHIVAL PLATE 06-A</span>
      <span class="opacity-50">//</span>
      <span>জাপি আৰু তাল চক্ৰ (ASSAMESE JAAPI &amp; TALA ACOUSTIC MANDALA)</span>
    </div>
    <span class="stamp stamp-verified">GENERATIVE CODE</span>
  </div>

  <div class="flex justify-center my-4 overflow-x-auto">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 520 520" width="460" height="460" class="max-w-full h-auto">
      <defs>
        <!-- Background radial grid -->
        <pattern id="archivalGrid" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <path d="M 20 0 L 0 0 0 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.5" opacity="0.15" />
        </pattern>
      </defs>

      <!-- Background circle -->
      <circle cx="260" cy="260" r="250" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <circle cx="260" cy="260" r="242" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
      <circle cx="260" cy="260" r="215" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" />
      <circle cx="260" cy="260" r="160" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75" />
      <circle cx="260" cy="260" r="110" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" />
      <circle cx="260" cy="260" r="60" fill="none" stroke="#942A27" stroke-width="1.5" />

      <!-- 16 Radial spokes representing the 16 woven bamboo ribs of the Jaapi & 16 Matras of Teental -->
      <g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75" opacity="0.6">
        <!-- 16 Radial Lines at 22.5 deg intervals -->
        <line x1="260" y1="45" x2="260" y2="475" />
        <line x1="45" y1="260" x2="475" y2="260" />
        <line x1="108" y1="108" x2="412" y2="412" />
        <line x1="108" y1="412" x2="412" y2="108" />

        <line x1="178" y1="62" x2="342" y2="458" />
        <line x1="342" y1="62" x2="178" y2="458" />
        <line x1="62" y1="178" x2="458" y2="342" />
        <line x1="62" y1="342" x2="458" y2="178" />
      </g>

      <!-- Gamusa Red-Diamond Woven Motifs along the 160-215 ring -->
      <g stroke="#942A27" fill="none" stroke-width="1.2">
        <polygon points="260,165 272,187 260,210 248,187" />
        <polygon points="260,355 272,333 260,310 248,333" />
        <polygon points="165,260 187,272 210,260 187,248" />
        <polygon points="355,260 333,272 310,260 333,248" />

        <polygon points="193,193 210,200 200,217 183,210" />
        <polygon points="327,327 310,320 320,303 337,310" />
        <polygon points="327,193 310,200 320,217 337,210" />
        <polygon points="193,327 210,320 200,303 183,310" />
      </g>

      <!-- Teental Classical Tala Beat Markers on Outer Perimeter -->
      <!-- SAM (X) at Top (Matra 1) -->
      <text x="260" y="32" font-family="monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#942A27" text-anchor="middle">SAM [X] // DHA (1)</text>
      <!-- TALI 2 at Right (Matra 5) -->
      <text x="495" y="264" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="currentColor" text-anchor="start">TALI 2 // DHA (5)</text>
      <!-- KHALI 0 at Bottom (Matra 9) -->
      <text x="260" y="495" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#1D4ED8" text-anchor="middle">KHALI [0] // DHA (9)</text>
      <!-- TALI 3 at Left (Matra 13) -->
      <text x="25" y="264" font-family="monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="currentColor" text-anchor="end">TALI 3 // TA (13)</text>

      <!-- Microtonal Shrutis / Pitch ratios -->
      <text x="365" y="145" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">r₁: 16/15 (Komal Re)</text>
      <text x="365" y="380" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">g₂: 6/5 (Komal Ga)</text>
      <text x="155" y="380" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">d₁: 8/5 (Komal Dha)</text>
      <text x="155" y="145" font-family="monospace" font-size="8" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">m₂: 45/32 (Teevra Ma)</text>

      <!-- Central Red Jaapi Sun & Assamese Inscriptions -->
      <circle cx="260" cy="260" r="48" fill="#942A27" opacity="0.1" />
      <circle cx="260" cy="260" r="28" fill="#942A27" opacity="0.2" />
      
      <text x="260" y="246" font-family="'Newsreader', serif" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#942A27" text-anchor="middle">দাপোন</text>
      <text x="260" y="264" font-family="'Newsreader', serif" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" text-anchor="middle">লুইতৰ পৰা ৱাকাতিলৈ</text>
      <text x="260" y="280" font-family="monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7" text-anchor="middle">AUCKLAND &bull; 45° S &bull; NZST</text>

      <!-- Decorative corner brackets -->
      <path d="M 15 35 L 15 15 L 35 15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <path d="M 505 35 L 505 15 L 485 15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <path d="M 15 485 L 15 505 L 35 505" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <path d="M 505 485 L 505 505 L 485 505" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="text-xs text-paper-margin dark:text-terminal-muted max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed border-t border-paper-pencil dark:border-terminal-wire pt-3">
    <strong>Iconographic Synthesis:</strong> 16-rib bamboo framework of the Assamese <em>Jaapi</em> (জাপি) mapped onto the 16-matra metric cycle of North Indian <em>Teental</em> (4+4+4+4). The geometric Gamusa diamonds trace the 22 microtonal shrutis, linking the heritage of the Brahmaputra (লুইত) with Southern Hemisphere quantum research.
  </div>
</div>

